==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] with [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Cat Gunslinger]], [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] and/or [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]] to beat the level. Use 3 or 4 meatshields.

Start out by putting your meatshields ([[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]]), making sure to deploy them simultaneously whenever they recharge, then spawn a Paris Cat every single time she recharges while repeating the first step over and over again. Paris is mainly used for the Gory Darks, but she is really good for the Shadow Boxer Ks as well.

Should you have Flower Cat's [[True Form]], this stage will be a joke, as only two are needed to permafreeze all Dark enemies present.

